abstract: >-
  An integrated release of WRRA Game 0.1, WRRA Game 0.2, and WRRA Go 0.1,
  covering constructive Omok and Go examples, exhaustive finite-state
  validation, and a playable Go engine with a transparent eleven-channel
  Renderer, Monte Carlo Tree Search, and machine-readable decision ledgers.
